text
@                   Resource Manager Display
                   ------------------------

Use This editor to view the Resource Manager table. It displays
all the information about all the VXI devices present in the system.

Field Description:
------------------
Log Addr: Logical address of the device (hex) 

Device Name: Device name

Cmdr LA: Logical address of the commander (hex) 

Frame: Logical address of frame extender (VXI-MXI) (hex)

Slot: Slot number (hex)

MfrId: Manufacturer number (hex)

Mfr Name: Manufacturer name

ModNo: Model number (hex)

Model Name: Model name

DevClass: 0 = MEM,  1 = EXT, 2 = MBD, 3 = RBD

SubCls: Sub Class (hex)

MemSpace: Address Space

MemBase: Base of the memory (hex)

MemSize: Size of the memory (hex)

IrqLevel: Interrupt levels for device (bit vector, hex)

IrqHandle: Interrupt Handlers for device (bit vector, hex)

Servants:  Displays servants of the device 

Usage
-----
This editor supports the following commands:

(1) list      [<index#>,[<index#>]] - lists all the entries in the 
                                      specified range.
(2) display   [<index#>,[<index#>]] - displays the entries in details.
(3) exit                            - lets you exit the editor.
(4) help                            - gives help on that editor.



@


